    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "msgctxt": "517980",
      "tipo": "popupStd_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "msgctxt": "518000",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "518056",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "518140",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "518220",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "518288",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "518328",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "518360",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "518392",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "―――It feels like I was dreaming. Something nostalgic.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "518452",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My body―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "518468",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Feels much heavier.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "518488",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But there isn't a trace of discomfort.\nIt's like this weight is from me being back where I belong.\nIt's like this weight was mine since before I was even born.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "518648",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The wind caresses my cheek.\nThere are organisms here visible to me\nand microorganisms that aren't.\nThere's the sun, water, and air.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "518780",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The smell is a familiar, assorted mixture.\nIt's the scent of earth.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "518848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There's also one other scent that tickles my nostrils.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "518904",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's a soapy smell. The smell of bare skin.\nThe smell of clean clothes.\nAhh, I know what this is too.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "519008",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "After all, this face belongs to the girl I've\nbeen with for so long.\nThis is the face, the girl I wanted to protect\nand fought so hard for―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "519156",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Why do I remember all that?\nI thought that once I went through that door,\nI would forget everything―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "519264",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I rouse myself in a hurry.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "519292",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've taken notice that I'm naked\nand sitting inside of some sort of capsule.\nMoreover―――floating far off and above my sights is\na perfect, luminescent circle.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "519456",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's the Moon… that's how it looks like from Earth!\nIt's the actual Moon…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "519536",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Which must mean that I've returned from\nthat cyberspace, and am now on Earth.\nI still don't remember anything from before I joined\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but I haven't lost a single memory\nfrom my time on the Moon. And I'm on Earth?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "519784",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes, you've got it.\nI pulled off a little trick to bring you back\nhere from the Moon, Senpai.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "519880",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF smiles mischievously.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "519928",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So this is what her \"trick\" was…\nWell, I'm genuinely happy about it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "520000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But how did #C236196003Sakura#CDEF make it to Earth?\nI figured she couldn't exist outside of cyberspace――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "520108",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…well, whatever.\nI don't need to sweat the details.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "520164",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It may have only been temporary,\nbut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was connected to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nI bet she could pull of any sort of miracle.\nIt would also be thoughtless of me\nto hound her with questions.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "520384",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes, so as you can see, we made it here.\nI did it because you told me you were\nokay with that.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "520480",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…okay.\nIt was an impossible wish that I could never expect\nto come true, but I'm very glad that I stated it anyway.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "520600",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Unless I take a second, I may make myself dizzy\nout of extreme joy and end up falling back asleep.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "520700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Take your time.\nI'll be so lonesome if you go off to sleep\nagain. You're always so easygoing, Senpai.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "520804",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm aware of that.\nI'd appreciate it if she didn't point it out.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "520872",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I can be absentminded at times,\nbut put me on the spot and I'll get flustered just like\nany ordinary person.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "520984",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Not ordinary; you're a sliver above average\nand a powerhouse when it comes to\ntaking initiative.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "521084",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The reason you were able to help me through\neverything that happened in that false world is\nbecause you're that kind of person. However―",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "521224",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "However, I'm a little uneasy.\nEverything here is physical.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "521284",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "We move via simple mechanisms,\nbut I bet that there's plenty of things\nwe can't do very deftly.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "521380",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yeah, she's not wrong.\n#RUBS    Here  #RUBEOn Earth#REND, theory alone isn't everything.\nLimited resources and ambitions make this world go round.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "521528",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In this human world, even in the face of an optimal solution,\na clash with emotions can lead to trekking\nin unforeseen directions.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "521660",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Still, that's the reason why―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "521696",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So many futures, so many unknowns come to be.\nIt's scary, but it also sends my heart aflutter.\nThis is the world we'll live in―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "521832",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In this world, spend enough time\nand love will take shape, right?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "521900",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…that's right.\nI obtained neither the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF nor a miracle.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "521984",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Despite being summoned to the Moon, rather than being a hero\nand accomplishing something great, I chose something\nexpected for a human to choose.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "522132",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Whether that decision was correct depends\non what I do from here on out.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "522208",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "―――Which is why I have only one thing to say right now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "522268",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Okay, where should we go, Senpai? We could just\nlive here in peace, but I don't think you'll\nsit still for very long.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "522388",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's the kind of person you are. You push\nonward even when you're powerless.\nYou yearn for a future you have yet to see.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "522512",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…yep. Humans and puppets were drawn to you\nbecause of the kind of person you are.\nI eventually wanted to support you.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "522632",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My one wish is to be with you forever.\nThe dream you had is my dream… but just know\nthat infidelity is unacceptable.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "522752",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Her satisfied smile is a tad blinding.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "522792",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…yeah. I have only one thing to say right now:",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "522840",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm glad I protected this smile.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "522876",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even if it meant parting with an almighty miracle.\nTo see this tiny miracle that blossomed from\nthe Moon smiling here―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "523000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Anyway―――S-Senpai.\nIt's a little late for this,\nbut do you mind if I say something?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "523088",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It took a while for me say this,\nbut how you feel about me makes me happy.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "523164",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I get up out of the capsule.\n\"Now that's something to hear,\" I smile back.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "523240",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My limbs aren't moving exactly as I'd like them to yet,\nbut I can clearly feel the earth and the wind.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "523344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My battle continues.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "msgctxt": "523368",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But now I won't be contending for something.\nIt'll be to nurture something.\nAnd if it's going to prove difficult anyway,\nif the goal is going to be unending,\nthen let the future be unreachable.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "msgctxt": "523564",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\n\n For example―yeah.\n Let the future extend so far that I one day get another\n chance to meet all those people I miss so.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "msgctxt": "523688",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\n\n\n  ―――I find myself looking up at the sky, so out of reach.",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
